        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Musa Aron ak werikyik, Oyoi banyek eng’ kurgetab emait ne kituiyechin: ak oam eng’ oloto koboto makatinik che mi aterut ne kigitabanji boisietab katabanet, ko u ye kiang’at, ale, Amei Aron ak werikyik choto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak obeel eng’ ma banyek ak makatinik che kang’et. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak momandoi eng’ kurgetab emait ne kituiyechin eng’ betusiek tisab, agoi kosulda betusiekwok che kitabananenok: amu itabanok eng’ betusiek tisab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ko u ye kageyai rani, ko u noto kagong’at Jehovah keyai, si koyai kagaigaet agobo okwek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak otebe kurgetab emait ne kituiyechin betusiek tisab bet ak kemoi, oribe kotigonutikab Jehovah, si mobegu: amu kaging’ata ko u noto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyai anyun Aron ak werikyik tuguk tugul che king’at Jehovah eng’ Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
